<!-- ================= FAQ ================= -->
<section class="faq band" aria-labelledby="faq-h">
  <div class="wrap faq__grid">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2 id="faq-h">Questions we get asked most.</h2><p class="muted">Still unsure about something? Call 1300 243 732 and talk to the people who’ll do the work.</p></div>
    <div class="faq__list">
      <details open><summary>Do I need a licensed installer for CCTV and alarms in NSW?<i><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg></i></summary><p>Yes. In NSW, installing, maintaining or advising on security equipment requires a licence under the Security Industry Act 1997. CGF holds Master Licence 000104676, and every electrical connection is covered by Contractor Licence 487799C.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can you work with my existing cameras or alarm?<i><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg></i></summary><p>Often, yes. We service and upgrade most major brands, including Dahua, Bosch, AJAX and Inception. If existing equipment is past its useful life, we’ll tell you and quote both options.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How much does CCTV installation cost in Sydney?<i><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg></i></summary><p>It depends on how many cameras you need, the cabling runs and how footage is recorded. We quote in writing after a site visit, so the price you approve is the price you pay.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I view my cameras on my phone?<i><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg></i></summary><p>Yes. We set up the app at handover and show you live view, playback and alerts before we leave.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you install EV chargers and home batteries?<i><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg></i></summary><p>Yes. We check your switchboard first, then size the charger or battery to how you generate and use power.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you look after strata buildings?<i><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg></i></summary><p>Yes. We install and maintain lobby intercoms, fob access and common-area CCTV for strata committees and building managers.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

